Description: multi-provider AI agent with terminal and web interfaces
 GnomeAI-RS provides a terminal coding agent and a local WebTool with shared
 provider, model, Web Search, and persistent-memory settings.
 .
 The package bundles the official OpenAI Codex app-server runtime and a
 rootless, lazy Firecrawl deployment with complete corresponding AGPL source.
